pve-routedip (1.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add a per network device rp_filter switch: strict reverse path filtering
    (rp_filter=1) on tap-only devices, with net.ipv4.conf.all.rp_filter lowered
    to 0 while needed and re-applied after sysctl reloads.

